# fabric / architectury
# Each platform's dev run directory (fabric/run-client, neoforge/run, ...) holds game logs,
# screenshots, saves and per-instance config: runtime state, never source. The bare "run/" rule
# alone misses the suffixed directories, which is how a whole run-client tree once showed up as
# untracked and would have been swept into a commit by "git add -A".

run/
run-*/
.architectury-transformer/

# java

hs_err_*.log
replay_*.log
*.hprof
*.jfr
